help-sidebar.control.item.create-clone-o:
Cruthaigh clón nua den Sprid `sprite_class`. Rithfidh aon mhodhanna `@pytch.when_I_start_as_a_clone` don chlón nua sin.

```
class Apple(pytch.Sprite):
    @pytch.when_key_pressed("n")
    def make_new_Banana(self):
        self.create_clone_of(Banana)
```

(B’fhéidir go bhfeicfeá `pytch.create_clone_of()`, a oibríonn freisin, i seanchód.)
